# Liquid nitrogen: one phase change pays for another (virtual investigation only)
# Real liquid nitrogen can cause severe cold burns and displace breathable air.
# Use only with trained supervision, eye/face protection, cryogenic gloves,
# strong ventilation, and an open pressure-relief path. Never seal a cryogen.
register lv1
# 0.1713 mol and 2.8807 mol correspond to 10 mL ethanol and 100 mL LN2
# at the cited liquid densities. Molar additions use the audited phase route.
add v1 ethanol 0.17126484mol
add v1 liquid_nitrogen 2.88070251mol
measure v1 thermometer
look v1
register lv3
inspect
